rief?","options":["Immediately, leaving them to manage themselves.","Publicly while parents wait.","After safe handover, or at an agreed later time."],"correct":2,"explanation":"Do not abandon supervision for an adult conversation."},{"id":"mentoring-after-3","prompt":"A follow-up is due. What should you ask first?","options":["Was the previous action tried, and what happened?","Which new topic can replace the old one?","Did the team win?"],"correct":0,"explanation":"Check the agreed experiment before adding another demand."}],"takeaway":"Agree one action, one resource, an owner and a next check.","sourceRefs":[]}
